haka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_20\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एतद्विद्यामनुशिष्टस्त्वयाहं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एतत् विद्याम् अनुशिष्टः त्वया अहम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_21\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वराणामेषवरस्तृतीय</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वराणाम् एषः वरः तृतीयः</span></span> ”</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_22\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_23\"><span class=\"bhsj\">श्रुतिं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">श्रुतिम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_24\">व्याचष्टे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_25\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्रेत</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्रेते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_26\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_27\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_28\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_29\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div>","<div class=\"side-zone\" data-side=\"anubhuti\"><div class=\"zlabel\">अनुभूतिप्रकाशः</div><div class=\"tika dv\"><div class=\"tk\"><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ११।३ · कठ १।१।२०</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_0\">प्रेते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_1\">मनुष्ये</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_2\"><span class=\"bhsj\">संदेहो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">संदेहः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_3\"><span class=\"bhsj\">भूयान्मतविभेदतः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">भूयान् मत-विभेदतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_4\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पारलौकिक</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पारलौकिकः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_6\"><span class=\"bhsj\">आत्मास्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">आत्मा अस्ति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_7\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नास्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न अस्ति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_8\">वा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_9\"><span class=\"bhsj\">निर्णयं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">निर्णयम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_10\">वद</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_11\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_12\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_13\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"1.1.20\" data-lemma=\"येयं प्रेते विचिकित्सा मनुष्ये ऽस्तीत्येकेनायमस्तीति चैके एतद्विद्यामनुशिष्टस्त्वयाहं वराणामेषवरस्तृतीय\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:0\" data-jpinw=\"या\" data-jmt=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:0\">“ <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_14\"><span class=\"bhsj\">येयं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">या इयम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_15\">प्रेते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_16\">विचिकित्सा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_17\">मनुष्ये</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_18\">ऽस्तीत्येकेनायमस्तीति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_19\"><span class=\"bhsj\">चैके</span><span class=\"bhsp\">च एके</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_20\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एतद्विद्यामनुशिष्टस्त्वयाहं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एतत् विद्याम् अनुशिष्टः त्वया अहम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_21\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वराणामेषवरस्तृतीय</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वराणाम् एषः वरः तृतीयः</span></span> ”</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_22\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_23\"><span class=\"bhsj\">श्रुतिं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">श्रुतिम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_24\">व्याचष्टे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_25\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्रेत</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्रेते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_26\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_27\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_28\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.20:tanubhuti_0_29\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div></div></div>","<div class=\"tk-inline\" data-side=\"anubhuti\" data-label=\"अनुभूतिप्रकाशः\"><span class=\"tk-grp\" data-jgrp=\"5\" data-gs=\"anubhuti\"></span><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ११।४–५ · कठ १।१।२१–२५</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_0\"><span class=\"bhsj\">चार्वाका</span><span class=\"bhsp\">चार्वाकाः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_1\"><span class=\"bhsj\">देहमेवाहुः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">देहम् एव आहुः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_2\">कर्मिणः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_3\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स्वर्गगामिनम्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">स्वर्ग-गामिनम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_4\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मुमुक्षवो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मुमुक्षवः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_6\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मुच्यमानमित्युक्तो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मुच्यमानम् इति उक्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_7\"><span class=\"bhsj\">गुरुराह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">गुरुः आह</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_8\">तम्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_9\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_10\">४</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_11\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_12\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मतभेदः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मत-भेदः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_13\"><span class=\"bhsj\">संशयहेतुरित्युक्तमेव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">संशय-हेतुः इति उक्तम् एव</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_14\">विशदयति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_15\"><span class=\"bhsj\">चार्वाका</span><span class=\"bhsp\">चार्वाकाः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_16\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_17\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_18\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_19\">नचिकेतसम्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_20\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_21\">४</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_22\">॥</span></span> </div></details> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_23\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दुर्विज्ञेयमणुत्वात्तद्देवैश्च</span><span class=\"bhsp\">दुर्विज्ञेयम् अणुत्वात् तत् देवैः च</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_24\">विचिकित्सितम्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_25\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_26\"><span class=\"bhsj\">त्यक्त्वैतत्पुत्रवित्तादीन्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">त्यक्त्वा एतत् पुत्र-वित्त-आदीन्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_27\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वृणीष्वेत्युक्त</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वृणीष्व इति उक्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_28\">आह</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_29\">तम्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_30\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_31\">५</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_32\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"1.1.25\" data-lemma=\"देवैरपि विचिकित्सितं पुरा नहि सुविज्ञेयमणुरेषधर्म\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Kathaka:1.1.21:0\" data-jpinw=\"देवैः\" data-jmt=\"Kathaka:1.1.21:0\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_33\"><span class=\"bhsj\">देवैरपि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">देवैः अपि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_34\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विचिकित्सितं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विचिकित्सितम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_35\">पुरा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_36\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नहि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न हि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_37\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सुविज्ञेयमणुरेषधर्म</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सुविज्ञेयम् अणुः एषः धर्मः</span></span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_38\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इत्यादि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इति-आदि</span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"1.1.25\" data-lemma=\"नहीं दृशा लम्भनीया मनुष्यै\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:13\" data-jpinw=\"न\" data-jmt=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:13\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_39\" data-g=\"anubhuti\" data-flag>नहीं</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_40\">दृशा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_41\">लम्भनीया</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_42\">मनुष्यै</span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_43\">रित्यन्तं</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_44\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नचिकेतसं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">नचिकेतसम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_45\">प्रति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_46\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यमवाक्यं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">यम-वाक्यम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_47\">व्याचष्टे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_48\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दुर्विज्ञेयमिति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">दुर्विज्ञेयम् इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_49\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_50\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इत्युक्तो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इति उक्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_51\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नचिकेता</span><span class=\"bhsp\">नचिकेताः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_52\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_53\">शेषः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_54\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_55\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_56\">यमम्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_57\">।।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_58\">५</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_59\">।।</span></span> </div></details></div>","<div class=\"side-zone\" data-side=\"anubhuti\"><div class=\"zlabel\">अनुभूतिप्रकाशः</div><div class=\"tika dv\"><div class=\"tk\"><span c