a:1.1.21:0\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_33\"><span class=\"bhsj\">देवैरपि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">देवैः अपि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_34\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विचिकित्सितं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विचिकित्सितम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_35\">पुरा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_36\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नहि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न हि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_37\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सुविज्ञेयमणुरेषधर्म</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सुविज्ञेयम् अणुः एषः धर्मः</span></span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_38\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इत्यादि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इति-आदि</span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"1.1.25\" data-lemma=\"नहीं दृशा लम्भनीया मनुष्यै\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:13\" data-jpinw=\"न\" data-jmt=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:13\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_39\" data-g=\"anubhuti\" data-flag>नहीं</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_40\">दृशा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_41\">लम्भनीया</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_42\">मनुष्यै</span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_43\">रित्यन्तं</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_44\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नचिकेतसं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">नचिकेतसम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_45\">प्रति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_46\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यमवाक्यं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">यम-वाक्यम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_47\">व्याचष्टे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Kathaka:1.1.25:tanubhuti_0_48\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दुर्विज्ञेयमिति</span><span cla